e final price you pay. It includes all taxes, tolls, and fees. There are no hidden charges."},{"q":"What payment methods do you accept?","a":"We accept payments via Bank Transfer and Cash on Pickup. For bank transfers, you will be required to upload proof of payment to confirm your booking."},{"q":"What happens if my flight is delayed?","a":"For all airport pickups, we monitor your flight status in real-time. Our driver will be there to meet you at the new arrival time, at no extra cost. We offer a complimentary waiting time of 90 minutes after your flight has landed."},{"q":"Where will I meet my driver at the airport?","a":"Your driver will be waiting in the arrivals hall after you exit customs, holding a sign with your name on it. For detailed instructions, please see our Airport Pickup Guidelines page."},{"q":"Can I request a child seat?","a":"Yes, child seats can be requested as an 'addon' service during the booking process, subject to availability. Please specify the type of seat needed (infant, toddler) if possible."},{"q":"What is your cancellation policy?","a":"Cancellations made more than 24 hours before the scheduled pickup time are fully refundable. Cancellations made within 24 hours may be subject to a cancellation fee. Please see our full Refund Policy for more details."}]}